+From 066a4852bd49932ccaa7f4d935f9ac9c63f90ef2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Ilia Lin <ilialin@codeaurora.org>
+Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2015 11:51:24 +0300
+Subject: [PATCH 1/2] target: Support dual display on SBC8016
+
+Support LCD/HDMI switching via "oem select" on the SBC8016.
+Use below commands to set 1080p hdmi display, the settings are
+persistent across power cycles:
+* Reboot the device into fastboot mode
+* fastboot oem select-display-panel adv7533_1080p
+* Reboot device
+Use below commands to set 720p hdmi display, the settings are
+persistent across power cycles:
+* Reboot the device into fastboot mode
+* fastboot oem select-display-panel adv7533_720p
+* Reboot device
+Use below commands to set 1080p DSI LCD display,
+the settings are persistent across power cycles:
+* Reboot the device into fastboot mode
+* fastboot oem select-display-panel jdi_1080p_video
+* Reboot device
+
+Change-Id: I4edca59c42a0fe81b71698c1529d2a3dd339d8e7
+---
+ target/msm8916/include/target/display.h | 13 ++++++++++++-
+ target/msm8916/init.c                   |  1 +
+ target/msm8916/target_display.c         | 32 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
